      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا تَعَلَّكْتُ بِعَلُوكٍ</span></b>  [<i>I have not occupied myself
in chewing with anything that is chewed;</i> or] <i>I
have not tasted anything;</i> and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاتَأَلَّكْتُ بِأَلُوكٍ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا تَعَلَّجْتُ بِعَلُوجٍ</span>. (O in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علج</span>.)

